eller's available listing: \\\"Message Seller\\\" dialog's Send button is disabled while empty; after typing \\\"Hi! Is this chair still available?...\\\" and sending, dialog closed with toast \\\"Message sent to seller!\\\".\"}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-21\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Category chosen on /categories does not filter browse results\", \"actual\": \"On a fresh load of /categories (which lists e.g. \\\"Furniture 3 items\\\"), clicking Furniture navigates to /?category=furniture but the browse page shows all 10 available listings (\\\"10 items available\\\") with no category checkbox checked. The category URL parameter is ignored. (Clicking a category tile on the home page's own \\\"Shop by Category\\\" section does filter correctly, e.g. Home Decor → 2 items.)\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"FT-22\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Sellers have no way to view received purchase requests/messages\", \"actual\": \"Buyer \\\"Buy Tester\\\" sent a message on Sofia's listing prod-9 (toast \\\"Message sent to seller!\\\") and earlier a cart-wide request reported \\\"Purchase requests sent to sellers!\\\". Signed in as sofia@example.com, /my-listings shows only her 3 listings with View/Mark Sold/Delete and no requests or messages section; the only other account page, \\\"My Profile\\\" (/profile), renders a 404 \\\"Oops! Page not found\\\". No UI anywhere surfaces the requested item or buyer message, and the cart confirmation is shown unconditionally.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-10\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Login with nonexistent.user9@example.com rejected: toast \\\"Invalid credentials. Try: emma@example.com\\\", stayed on /login, no session created.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-11\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Registering \\\"EMMA@Example.com\\\" (case variant of existing emma@example.com) rejected with toast \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\"; stayed on /register, no session, existing account untouched.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-12\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Password is not verified at login; any password authenticates a registered account\", \"actual\": \"Registered test.seller1@example.com with password \\\"seller123\\\", logged out, then signed in with \\\"wrongpass999\\\" — login succeeded (redirected to home, header shows Sell/user menu instead of Log in/Sign up). Login page even states \\\"(any password works)\\\".\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-13\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Owner (Test Seller) sees Mark Sold/Delete on /my-listings and \\\"Manage Your Listings\\\" on the product page. Signed in as emma@example.com the same listing (prod-1787836903965) exposes only \\\"Add to Cart\\\" and \\\"Message Seller\\\" — no edit/mark-sold/delete controls.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-14\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Empty submit blocked by required-field validation (\\\"Please fill out this field.\\\" on title/description/price); with text fields filled but no category/condition → toast \\\"Please fill in all required fields\\\"; with all fields but no photo → toast \\\"Please add at least one image\\\". No listing created in any case.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-15\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Price -50 submit rejected: input[type=number][min=0] invalid with \\\"Value must be greater than or equal to 0.\\\"; stayed on /create-listing, no listing created. Non-numeric text cannot be entered in the number field (becomes empty → required error).\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CS-23\", \"verdict\": \"FAIL\", \"issue\": \"Protected routes render a blank page for signed-out users instead of redirecting or prompting sign-in\", \"actual\": \"Signed out, /create-listing, /cart and /my-listings all render an empty document (document.body.innerText === \\\"\\\", no header, no toast, no redirect — URL stays put). In-app actions do work correctly: Add to Cart redirects to /login with toast \\\"Please log in to add items to your cart\\\", and Message Seller shows a \\\"Log in to message\\\" dialog.\", \"evidence\": null}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-16\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Immediate toast \\\"An account with this email already exists\\\" appeared without navigation; registration form stayed populated and editable for correction.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-17\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Typing into the search box updated the grid and the \\\"N items available\\\" counter live (11 → 3 for \\\"WOOD\\\"/\\\"portland\\\", → 2 for \\\"BARN\\\", back to 11 when cleared) with no search button/Enter needed.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-18\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Each filter/sort change re-rendered results and the \\\"N items available\\\" counter instantly (Furniture 11→4, +New →2, upcycled-only →6, min price $150 →3, distance 3 mi →3, sort Price low-high reordered $35…$320). \\\"Clear all filters\\\" reset all checkboxes, price to $0-$500, distance to Any and restored all 11 available listings.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"IX-19\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"Add to Cart produced an immediate \\\"Added to cart!\\\" toast and the header badge incremented 0→1→2 without reload; opening /cart (SPA navigation) showed the new line items and updated total $120.00.\"}, {\"item_id\": \"CT-20\", \"verdict\": \"PASS\", \"issue\": null, \"actual\": null, \"evidence\": \"/product/prod-1 shows main photo + 2 thumbnails, title, description, $285, Furniture, Like New, \\\"Brooklyn, NY (2.5 mi)\\\", seller Emma Green, \\\"Listed 2024-11-20\\\" and an Upcycled badge — all matching the browse card (Upcycled|$285|Brooklyn, NY|Like New). Availability is conveyed by Add to Car